th d=\"M 225.752727 133.76 L 365.534545 133.76 L 365.534545 17.6 L 225.752727 17.6 z\n\" clip-path=\"url(#p0cd0fe58fc)\" style=\"fill: #c2410c\"/></g><g id=\"patch_5\"><path d=\"M 35.3 133.76 L 35.3 11.792 \" style=\"fill: none; stroke: #c9d1dc; stroke-width: 0.8; stroke-linejoin: miter; stroke-linecap: square\"/></g><g id=\"patch_6\"><path d=\"M 35.3 133.76 L 381.26 133.76 \" style=\"fill: none; stroke: #c9d1dc; stroke-width: 0.8; stroke-linejoin: miter; stroke-linecap: square\"/></g><g id=\"text_8\"><g style=\"fill: #2d3748\" transform=\"translate(112.628239 38.041356) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><defs><path id=\"IBMPlexSans-Regular-5a\" d=\"M 870 -77 Q 672 -77 576 28 Q 480 134 480 294 L 480 378 Q 480 544 576 646 Q 672 749 870 749 Q 1075 749 1168 646 Q 1261 544 1261 378 L 1261 294 Q 1261 134 1168 28 Q 1075 -77 870 -77 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"IBMPlexSans-Regular-41\" d=\"M 1696 0 L 1120 0 L 2829 4006 L 922 4006 L 922 3174 L 442 3174 L 442 4467 L 3373 4467 L 3373 3994 L 1696 0 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"IBMPlexSans-Regular-3f\" d=\"M 3187 4467 L 3187 3994 L 1229 3994 L 1101 2291 L 1146 2291 Q 1254 2445 1376 2553 Q 1498 2662 1664 2723 Q 1830 2784 2061 2784 Q 2445 2784 2745 2617 Q 3046 2451 3219 2144 Q 3392 1837 3392 1402 Q 3392 966 3213 633 Q 3034 301 2698 112 Q 2362 -77 1888 -77 Q 1517 -77 1254 35 Q 992 147 809 320 Q 627 493 493 685 L 896 992 Q 1069 730 1277 566 Q 1485 403 1888 403 Q 2342 403 2582 646 Q 2822 890 2822 1331 L 2822 1395 Q 2822 1837 2582 2080 Q 2342 2323 1888 2323 Q 1581 2323 1405 2211 Q 1229 2099 1088 1946 L 634 2010 L 794 4467 L 3187 4467 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3e\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-5a\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-41\" transform=\"translate(87.203125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3f\" transform=\"translate(147.203125 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_9\"><g style=\"fill: #2d3748\" transform=\"translate(287.355511 15.4) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><defs><path id=\"IBMPlexSans-Regular-43\" d=\"M 3411 2829 Q 3411 2330 3267 1894 Q 3123 1459 2883 1094 Q 2643 730 2364 451 Q 2086 173 1818 0 L 1126 0 Q 1606 352 1945 685 Q 2285 1018 2509 1408 Q 2733 1798 2854 2317 L 2822 2330 Q 2720 2150 2573 2003 Q 2426 1856 2224 1773 Q 2022 1690 1747 1690 Q 1363 1690 1065 1856 Q 768 2022 598 2332 Q 429 2643 429 3066 Q 429 3507 614 3840 Q 800 4173 1133 4358 Q 1466 4544 1914 4544 Q 2381 4544 2713 4336 Q 3046 4128 3228 3744 Q 3411 3360 3411 2829 z\nM 1920 2144 Q 2214 2144 2422 2253 Q 2630 2362 2742 2573 Q 2854 2784 2854 3085 L 2854 3136 Q 2854 3437 2742 3648 Q 2630 3859 2422 3968 Q 2214 4077 1920 4077 Q 1626 4077 1418 3968 Q 1210 3859 1098 3648 Q 986 3437 986 3136 L 986 3085 Q 986 2784 1098 2573 Q 1210 2362 1418 2253 Q 1626 2144 1920 2144 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3f\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-5a\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-43\" transform=\"translate(87.203125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-38\" transform=\"translate(147.203125 0)\"/></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"p0cd0fe58fc\"><rect x=\"35.3\" y=\"11.792\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"121.968\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · Yearly revenue ($M)","note":null},"answer":"<p><b>Commuters (before 10am, all day): $24</b>, about 650 spaces.</p> <p><b>Short stays (after 10am, up to 4 hours): $16</b>, about 300 cars; two can share a space, so they need about 150 spaces. 650 + 150 = 800.</p> <p><b>Evening (after 6pm): $8</b>, about 400 cars.</p> <p>Revenue: (650 × $24 + 300 × $16 + 400 × $8) × 250 = <b>$5.9M</b>, +24%.</p>"},{"q":"What could go wrong?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<ul><li>Commuters may resent paying $24; offer monthly passes at a small discount for loyalty</li><li>Need space-availability signs and an app so short-stay visitors know there's room</li> <li>Check local rules on evening charges and nearby residents' concerns</li></ul>"}],"reco":"Charge by time of day: $24 for all-day commuters, $16 for short stays after 10am, and $8 in the evening. Reserving about 150 spaces for short-stay visitors, who can share a space across the day, and filling the empty evenings raises revenue from $4.75M to about $5.9M a year (+24%). Offer monthly passes to keep regular commuters. Risk: commuters switching to rival car parks. Next step: install availability signs and test prices for three months.","great":["Sees time as the scarce resource","Segments users by when and how long they park","Checks the plan fits capacity","Keeps loyal commuters with passes"],"id":97,"slug":"gateway-parking"}